data: {"id": "bdbbe8009a534308-thinking-parallel_evidence-1775", "run_id": "bdbbe8009a534308", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到多维度直接证据，汇总如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl`\n- **UID**: `5c278abe-982e-4ea1-9540-d55e1de90b26`\n- **节点**: `node2` (IP: 10.2.0.50)\n- **Pod IP**: `172.16.104.63`\n- **控制器**: `ReplicaSet/workload-dff5cbc6b`\n\n### 2. 支持“CrashLoopBackOffRuntime”的证据\n- **K8s 事件 (`kubectl_events`, `kubectl_describe`)**: \n  - 75秒前至 6 分钟前，kubelet 持续上报 `Warning BackOff: Back-off restarting failed container app`。\n  - 这直接证实了 Pod 处于容器反复崩溃并退避的重启循环中。\n- **K8s YAML (`kubectl_get_yaml`)**:\n  - ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789072638282, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

